{"outcome":"component","existing":"","reason":"","code":"HistoryTimeline","label":"History timeline","description":"A vertical timeline of dated milestones, each with a date, a title, a text and an optional picture, joined by a line. Use it for the history of a company, a brand or a place told year by year.","props":"[{"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Heading", "max": 120}, {"name": "intro", "type": "html", "label": "Introduction", "help": "A short text shown under the heading, before the timeline."}, {"name": "events", "type": "items", "label": "Milestones", "min": 2, "max": 24, "items": [{"name": "date", "type": "text", "label": "Date", "help": "A year or a date, as it should be read: 1987, March 2015.", "required": true, "max": 40}, {"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Title", "required": true, "max": 120}, {"name": "text", "type": "html", "label": "Text"}, {"name": "image", "type": "image", "label": "Picture"}, {"name": "image_alt", "type": "text", "label": "Alternative text of the picture", "help": "What the picture shows, in one sentence. Leave empty for a decorative picture.", "max": 200}]}]","sample":"{"title": "Notre histoire", "intro": "<p>Depuis plus de trente ans, nous fabriquons nos produits dans le même atelier, avec le même soin.</p>", "events": [{"date": "1989", "title": "L’ouverture de l’atelier", "text": "<p>Marie et Paul Lefèvre ouvrent un petit atelier de maroquinerie à Clermont-Ferrand.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}, {"date": "1997", "title": "La première boutique", "text": "<p>La boutique de la rue du Port accueille ses premiers clients. Les sacs sont toujours cousus à la main.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}, {"date": "2008", "title": "Un nouvel atelier", "text": "<p>L’équipe passe à quinze personnes et s’installe dans un atelier plus grand, au bord de l’Allier.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}, {"date": "2016", "title": "La boutique en ligne", "text": "<p>Nos produits sont disponibles partout en France, livrés en 48 heures.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}, {"date": "2023", "title": "Le label Entreprise du patrimoine vivant", "text": "<p>L’État reconnaît l’excellence de notre savoir-faire artisanal.</p>", "image": null, "image_alt": ""}]}","template":"<section class="timeline">{% if props.title is not empty %}<h2 class="timeline__title">{{ props.title }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if props.intro is not empty %}<div class="timeline__intro">{{ props.intro }}</div>{% endif %}<ol class="timeline__list" data-cms-sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 32rem, 85vw">{% for event in props.events %}<li class="event"><p class="event__date">{{ event.date }}</p><h3 class="event__title">{{ event.title }}</h3>{% if event.text is not empty %}<div class="event__text">{{ event.text }}</div>{% endif %}{% if event.image %}<img class="event__image" src="{{ event.image }}" alt="{{ event.image_alt|default('') }}">{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></section>","css":".timeline__title { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
.timeline__intro { margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.timeline__list { position: relative; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 2rem; }
.timeline__list::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0.5rem; bottom: 0.5rem; left: calc(0.5rem - 1px); width: 2px; background: var(--cms-color-border); }
.event { position: relative; padding-bottom: 2rem; }
.event:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
.event::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -2rem; top: 0.25rem; width: 1rem; height: 1rem; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid var(--cms-color-surface); background: var(--cms-color-accent); }
.event__date { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; color: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); }
.event__title { margin: 0.25rem 0 0.5rem; color: var(--cms-color-text); }
.event__text { color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.event__text > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.event__text > :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.event__image { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; }
@media (min-width: 48rem) { .timeline__list { padding-left: 0; } .timeline__list::before { left: calc(11rem - 1px); } .event { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 9rem minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 4rem; } .event::before { left: 10.5rem; } .event__date { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / span 3; align-self: start; text-align: right; } .event__title { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; margin-top: 0; } .event__text, .event__image { grid-column: 2; } }"}
